      "content": "Interesting. Can you expand on why you'd categorize those religious/communal cycles as 'unpredictable'? In an actuarial sense, what specific variables in Profile B make them more volatile compared to someone with a structured Western schedule? Like, are you seeing higher risk in the lack of individual autonomy or something else?",
